      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 9 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "Where Will You Use the Baby Carrier? If you know you'll need a baby carrier that performs well in both warm and cold weather, look for a front-pack carrier with ventilation mesh and an extra winter layer, or consider buying two different sling-type carriers - a cotton summer weight and a winter fleece - to carry baby comfortably all year long. If you want to use the baby carrier in a rainy climate, or at the pool or beach, look for waterproof fabrics or a quick-dry mesh carrier designed for use in the water.\nUltimate Guide to Baby Carriers To know more details about the Baby Carriers visit\nhttp://10elite.com/ultimate-guide-to-baby-carriers",
